  "goodToKnow": "Die Besteuerung is taxation: die Besteuerung von Einkommen, Doppelbesteuerung (double taxation, prevented by treaties). Married couples in Germany can choose joint taxation, called Ehegattensplitting, which benefits single-earner couples and is much debated. Besteuern means to tax. Die Steuer is tax, but das Steuer is the steering wheel: am Steuer sitzen. Plural: die Besteuerungen."
